  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 601.07 Env-Dw 603.05\n\nDocument #11143 replaces all prior filings for rules in the former Chapter Env-Dw 600. The rules in the former Chapter Env-Dw 600 which had last been filed under Document #9107 and Document #9108 did not expire on 3-23-16 since they were extended pursuant to RSA 541-A:14-a until replaced by the rules in Document #11143, effective 7-26-16.",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-dw600.html"
